Opponent's Auto L-cancel (mu-engine/net/patches/mac-0004): slippi::online::opponent_auto_lcancel() says whether the other player of a
connected Direct match has Auto L-cancel on (its build message's flag 0x10, net-0011), for melee-unlocked's notice on the
character select (A5). Display only. Applied by ../../net_sources.sh after the net patches.
